[{"sha": "e687094a898caf49fbf2b5a2df9455e54e61e1b9", "node_id": "C_kwDOFeJkQdoAKGU2ODcwOTRhODk4Y2FmNDlmYmYyYjVhMmRmOTQ1NWU1NGU2MWUxYjk", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Brant Knudson", "email": "brant.knudson@hpe.com", "date": "2021-09-24T22:11:29Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Brant Knudson", "email": "brant.knudson@hpe.com", "date": "2021-09-24T22:11:29Z"}, "message": "CASMPET-4912: Add back excluded containerd mount point\n\nWhen https://github.com/Cray-HPE/cray-sysmgmt-health/pull/27/files was\nmade, it removed part of the changes done for\nhttps://github.com/Cray-HPE/cray-sysmgmt-health/commit/68e37942257034ca2c73ea79194ec584d0dddf3b\nto \"fix the mount points to ignore that node-exporter sees as an\nerrored devices\". This was unintentional and due to developing using\nthe old charts that are in vshasta. This change adds that back in.", "tree": {"sha": "04546e1b5b154c426e7ded563d2b920f051fb440", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Cray-HPE/cray-sysmgmt-health/git/trees/04546e1b5b154c426e7ded563d2b920f051fb440"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Cray-HPE/cray-sysmgmt-health/git/commits/e687094a898caf49fbf2b5a2df9455e54e61e1b9", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Cray-HPE/cray-sysmgmt-health/commits/e687094a898caf49fbf2b5a2df9455e54e61e1b9", "html_url": "https://github.com/Cray-HPE/cray-sysmgmt-health/commit/e687094a898caf49fbf2b5a2df9455e54e61e1b9", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Cray-HPE/cray-sysmgmt-health/commits/e687094a898caf49fbf2b5a2df9455e54e61e1b9/comments", "author": null, "committer": null, "parents": [{"sha": "3445ac9276edb1ec6d492900461b6b2810cc7639", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Cray-HPE/cray-sysmgmt-health/commits/3445ac9276edb1ec6d492900461b6b2810cc7639", "html_url": "https://github.com/Cray-HPE/cray-sysmgmt-health/commit/3445ac9276edb1ec6d492900461b6b2810cc7639"}]}, {"sha": "e947b19a8c97dc1f156f532d061ca86d46d117e7", "node_id": "C_kwDOFeJkQdoAKGU5NDdiMTlhOGM5N2RjMWYxNTZmNTMyZDA2MWNhODZkNDZkMTE3ZTc", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Brant Knudson", "email": "brant.knudson@hpe.com", "date": "2021-09-23T21:34:41Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Brant Knudson", "email": "brant.knudson@hpe.com", "date": "2021-09-23T21:34:41Z"}, "message": "CASMPET-4912: Fix collecting metrics for / on K8s NCNs\n\nnode-exporter wasn't collecting any metrics for the / filesystem\nbecause on the K8s NCNs its FSTYPE is 'overlay':\n\n```\nncn-m001:~ # findmnt /\nTARGET SOURCE        FSTYPE  OPTIONS\n/      LiveOS_rootfs overlay rw,relatime,lowerdir=/run/rootfsbase,upperdir=/run/overlayfs,workdir=/run/ovlwork\n```\n\nand the filesystem collector is configured to ignore overlay fs's. The\n'/' filesystem wasn't an overlay FS originally and overlay fs's are\nused for the containers so these were ignored.\n\nThis was causing there to be no alert when the `/` filesystem fills up\ndue to kubelet spewing messages into the logs.\n\nThe fix is to not ignore overlay fs's and make sure that the container\nfs's are ignored.", "tree": {"sha": "49a4183411c31a66bec810ee061736a1e4dfcfce", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Cray-HPE/cray-sysmgmt-health/git/trees/49a4183411c31a66bec810ee061736a1e4dfcfce"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Cray-HPE/cray-sysmgmt-health/git/commits/e947b19a8c97dc1f156f532d061ca86d46d117e7", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Cray-HPE/cray-sysmgmt-health/commits/e947b19a8c97dc1f156f532d061ca86d46d117e7", "html_url": "https://github.com/Cray-HPE/cray-sysmgmt-health/commit/e947b19a8c97dc1f156f532d061ca86d46d117e7", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Cray-HPE/cray-sysmgmt-health/commits/e947b19a8c97dc1f156f532d061ca86d46d117e7/comments", "author": null, "committer": null, "parents": [{"sha": "889e805c99e95d4804913ce36bc